1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,572
Here is the part worth keeping.

2
00:00:01,572 --> 00:00:03,002
She did not hide from it.

3
00:00:03,002 --> 00:00:13,543
Within weeks she was on music shows singing with a hand-held mic and no ear monitors — the most exposed setup an idol can choose — and letting the results post themselves.

4
00:00:13,543 --> 00:00:20,347
Whatever else 2026 would bring, the answer to November's discourse had already been filed in December.

